WEBVTT

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:16.670
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:27.690
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.220
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:38.720
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.700
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:49.500
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.530
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:59.880
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:11.200
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:23.440
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:34.940
"Watch out for sweet-talkers!"
"National Safe Driving Week"
This is National Safe
Driving Week.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.650
The total number of bicycle and
scooter thefts has recently...

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:47.150
...increased. So, I want you
all to keep your eyes out.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.660
Yes, sir!

00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.130
We'd like to ask for
your cooperation.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.740
Please read our announcement
from Bokuto Police Station.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:55.540
Dial 110 if you see anyone
suspicious!

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:58.170
"Dial 110 for police."

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:06.780
<i>Hey, you big road hog, get</i>
<i>outta my way, Honey!</i>

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:06.880
"One-Way Street"

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:16.160
<i>One-way street, running lights. Don't need</i>
<i>a reason to give you, do I, Honey?</i>

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.990
<i>Traffic Rules? Honey, I
don't give a hoot.</i>

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:29.370
<i>And no one will stop my scooter from</i>
<i>access to a highway. Honey!</i>

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:29.770
<i>To the east there</i>
<i>is a discount...</i>

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.000
"Discount"Super "Christmas"Cakes of the
Stores"Cheap" Mega Sale"world"

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.240
<i>To the east there</i>
<i>is a discount...</i>

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.350
<i>... to the west there</i>
<i>is a sale.</i>

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:38.780
"One Day Sale"
<i>... to the west there</i>
<i>is a sale.</i>

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:39.080
<i>To the north a bargain trail! To the</i>
<i>south there is a liquidation!</i>

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.310
"One Day Bargain Sale"

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:41.450
<i>To the north a bargain trail! To the</i>
<i>south there is a liquidation!</i>

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.390
"Winter"Super Customer
Closeout"Appreciation Day"

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:44.250
<i>The banners are calling out to me! In the</i>
<i>fliers and the papers, reductions galore!</i>

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.090
"Big Sale... Big Sale... Big Sale..."

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.230
<i>The banners are calling out to me! In the</i>
<i>fliers and the papers, reductions galore!</i>

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:50.560
"Winter Sale"

00:02:56.700 --> 00:03:06.470
<i>I'd better speed up before they</i>
<i>close the door, Honey!</i>

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:15.710
<i>If I don't hurry up and</i>
<i>make the sale...</i>

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:24.890
<i>... today's shopping mission</i>
<i>will have failed, Honey...</i>

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:28.990
<i>... and that would be a terrible loss. The</i>
<i>¥500 in gas will be a total loss.</i>

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:37.070
<i>Hey, you big road hog, get</i>
<i>outta my way, Honey!</i>

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:39.640
<i>The roads everywhere are mine, you see!</i>
<i>They all belong entirely to me!</i>

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.340
<i>They all belong entirely to me!</i>

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:57.680
<i>I'm going, going my way</i>
<i>on my 50cc, Honey!</i>

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.160
<i>Seven minutes to 5. Just in time</i>
<i>for today's pre-closing sales!</i>

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:08.100
<i>A line-up!</i>

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.210
"violet Bank"

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.530
Pardon!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.140
I want one of those,
too, Hon!

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.650
Of course. Here
you are!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.150
Huh? What's
this?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.710
Well, you
see...

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:27.150
This is no sale
flier!

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:28.680
"Sale flier?"

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.990
I've wasted precious
shopping minutes!

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:39.770
I'm gonna be late for the
pre-closing sales!

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:44.440
What an old bag!

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:49.740
FILE. 10
THE OUTLAW
SCOOTER
MAMA

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:52.140
Here you go.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.780
The... a...
on...

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.650
I only know a
few words!

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.410
I guess this is too hard
for you to read.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:00.080
Aoi, let me see your
panties!

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.160
Maybe next
time, dear.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:03.690
Is this a bad
guy?

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.950
If a person takes something that
belongs to someone else...

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.330
...does that make the person a
good person or a bad person?

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:10.830
I borrowed Shou's
crayons!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:14.200
Yuuta used up all of
Shou's blue crayon.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.840
He's my friend,
so it's okay.

00:05:17.010 --> 00:05:17.980
But friends shouldn't do that!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:19.540
I'm your friend, too!

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.110
That's not fair!

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.640
I wouldn't like that!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.150
Uh-oh!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.120
Excuse me! This
is a one-way...

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:37.020
I have a question.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:37.800
Huh?

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:41.750
There's a discount store selling 5 boxes of
tissues for ¥1,980, somewhere near here.

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.160
So, where is it?
I'm in a hurry!

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.660
Eh... er...

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:51.340
You don't know where it
is? That's ludicrous!

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:53.410
Can you really call yourself
a police officer?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.140
I'm very
sorry!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.150
You've wasted my
valuable time!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.950
Onward, to the discount
store!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.450
You're going the wrong way
down a one-way street!

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.190
She's gone.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.290
Wow!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.450
What a loony!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.930
Scooter Mama? Oh yeah,
I know who you mean.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.900
With that yellow
scooter.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.370
And she breaks traffic laws
every so often, right?

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.840
She's far worse
than that!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.700
If you know who she is, then why
don't you just haul her in?

00:06:28.310 --> 00:06:30.680
It's not as simple as
you make it sound.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:34.440
We can't just sit back and let her
do what she wants, though!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.920
Definitely!

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.420
But what can we
do to stop her?

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.060
Sneak up from behind
her, and!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.790
You can't kill that old
lady that easily.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.260
You're probably
right.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:51.560
How about approaching her
and asking her politely?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.630
Do you think she'd
even listen?

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.710
I guess not.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.970
Jeez, you sure are taking
this thing seriously.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:03.410
Well, it's work we're
talking about here!

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:07.380
I hear that scooter woman
has you all at her mercy!

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:11.710
Just leave her to "Bokuto's
White Hawk," right here!

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.230
<i>Gotcha. All right, lady, let's see</i>
<i>how good you really are.</i>

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.360
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.500
You're in my
way, Honey!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.230
<i>What?! She went</i>
<i>around him!</i>

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.850
Round One!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:14.720
Nice nose you
got there.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:17.350
How embarrassing.

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.490
Why don't you just quit
chasing her around?

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:21.680
You might get cursed if you keep after
the untouchable Scooter Mama.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:24.050
No, we should go on an all-out
campaign against her!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:26.390
We won't let Scooter Mama
get away with this!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.720
Yea!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.730
Huh. You sure seem
excited about this.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.430
How can you just sit back and do nothing?!
We'll catch her. Just you see!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:36.430
Hello. Any leads
on the thieves?

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.930
"Thieves?"

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:41.700
Who?

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.350
Oh! The thefts!

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:45.450
Oops, we
forgot!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.450
You forgot?

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:00.660
At this point, nothing is certain. But there
seem to be two patterns to the thieves.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.360
One is a younger, more
impulsive type.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:06.770
The other seems to be middle-aged,
and more methodical.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.430
The thefts have been occurring mostly
from late evening to early morning.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:12.640
How about the
rest of you?

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.010
We've passed out 5,000 of
these fliers, for starters.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.510
We've asked residents in the area to
give us any information they have...

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.450
...for starters...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.680
Hmm. Very
good.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.110
And Tsujimoto?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:26.690
Huh?! Me?
Uh...

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:43.600
It's standard practice for police-
women to work in pairs...

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:47.670
...and since Miyuki is busy here at
the station, I'm basically, uh...

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:51.010
...doing nothing.
Anyway...

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:51.980
I'm counting on you!

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.010
I'm counting on you!
Yes, Chief!

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.990
Please! Remain calm.
Just stay calm.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.060
It was stolen!

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:09.830
Pardon?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:12.830
Pardon?
My scooter was stolen!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.200
She's the Scooter
Mama.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:20.430
And her scooter...

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:21.980
...was stolen?

00:10:22.150 --> 00:10:25.110
"Scooter Mama."

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.080
"Ordinary Mama."

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.520
Well, time to get back to work.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.750
Off to handing out fliers.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:34.690
The whole world wants traffic safety...

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.490
I'm going!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:44.030
Umm, tell me exactly what
happened, ma'am.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.230
What are you police
doing, anyway?!

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:49.860
Are you searching for it?! Are
you bringing it back?!

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:52.000
Are you doing anything
at all, Hon?!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:00.480
They stole it!
My scooter!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:07.860
I understand. And where was the
last place you had it parked?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.020
Well, I bought some milk on special
at the Matsudaya Supermarket.

00:11:10.130 --> 00:11:12.460
Then I went to Moo Moo to get
a nightie that was 30% off.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:14.830
Then to the Harisen Discount Store by the
station, to get 5 boxes of kleenex.

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.330
Then, let's see... I went to Maruyuo to, er...

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:20.100
Yes, yes, but after all that, where was
the very last place you parked it?

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:22.930
Uh. I forget, Hon!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:28.110
I get it. Your scooter wasn't stolen...
You just forgot where you parked it!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.300
It's the police's job to
find out where it is!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:35.850
I'll put out an APB and the patrols
will keep an eye out for it.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.950
An APB isn't good
enough.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:40.150
It has to be found
immediately!

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:44.090
Then, for now, we can go look
where you think it might be.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:46.630
Let's go! Let's go!
On the double!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:51.000
Alright! Let's move it! Let's
go! Hell or high water!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.980
"Matsudaya Supermarket"

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:00.540
This is where I bought the milk.

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:01.650
Thank you for shopping!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:01.710
This is where I bought the milk.

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:03.410
Our special beat-the-clock sale begins soon!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.880
I left my scooter right around here.

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:08.680
If it's been stolen, it's
not going to be here.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.750
It's probably sold, or maybe
ditched somewhere.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:11.820
It's also possible that some thief rode off
on it and has just left it somewhere.

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:14.050
Ourten-minute special sale is about to begin!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:16.220
10% off everything.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.090
Everything is discounted at 10%.
This is a limited offer.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:19.890
Hmm? Aah!

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:20.700
Wait!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:21.030
Only forthe next ten minutes, 10%
off every item in the store.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:21.800
Did she find it?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:21.930
Only forthe next ten minutes, 10%
off every item in the store.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.030
Huh?

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:23.170
Only forthe next ten minutes, 10%
off every item in the store.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:25.900
Wait for me!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:31.400
La la, Hon!

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:34.930
Let me tell you. We're here
to look for your scooter.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:38.040
If you're planning to do your shopping
along the way, then we're going back!

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:41.910
It was a limited
offer, Hon!

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:47.350
That store was offering delicious
pastries for only ¥300 apiece!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:54.060
Outta my way! It's a ¥100-for-
everything-in-the-store sale!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.500
Like I said, we're not here to take
you on a shopping spree.

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:04.430
I can't stand this! What are
we?! Her chauffeurs?!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.240
Let's get out of
here, Miyuki!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.270
We can't. That would
be irresponsible.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:12.010
How so? We've done a lot for her! Have
you taken a look in the back?

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.810
There's tissue, there's frozen
food, there's even furniture.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:19.050
If she buys one
more thing!

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:20.820
Natsumi!

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:22.960
I'm chucking it.
It's all going!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.860
Come with me, Hon.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.590
Did you
find it?

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:33.740
What're the police doing here?

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:34.360
Did something happen?

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.500
I saved a lot by buying two cases
of Coke for the price of one!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:48.150
Listen! You've gotta sound angry,
Miss Miyuki Kobayakawa!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.620
I'm gonna tell her! I'm gonna
tell her for sure!

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:55.080
Please have one. With
my heartfelt thanks.

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:58.590
Thank you very much!
That's very kind.

00:13:58.760 --> 00:14:01.420
Aren't we simple-minded?
Oh wait!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.560
Oh, man...

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:08.390
I have some
tissue.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:16.680
Ew, yuck! Everything's covered
in sticky soda!

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.820
It's Natsumi!

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:23.680
Hi, Miyuki!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:27.250
Excuse me, there's only 3 minutes
left on the beat-the-clock sale!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.190
You're not going
to the sale.

00:14:29.360 --> 00:14:30.350
Oh.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.520
Hey!

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.130
Natsumi!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.130
What is it?

00:14:34.300 --> 00:14:37.100
Know what just happened? There
was a blue scooter here...

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.760
...and a bad guy came and
rode away on it.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:39.900
What do you mean
"bad?"

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:43.100
He didn't have a key, and he was
looking around all creepy.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:46.540
Which way
did he go?

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.180
Let's see... He went
that way!

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.640
Thank you.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:53.910
Where are
we going?

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.640
Hang on tight! And watch that
you don't bite your tongue.

00:14:57.150 --> 00:14:59.350
My scooter
is yellow!

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.850
Yea!

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:07.650
Young man on
the scooter!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.260
<i>Wha? Damn!</i>

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.270
You, on the blue scooter. Pull
over to the side of the road!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:15.970
Rats!

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:20.910
What is this? A caution?
Or a citation?

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:23.880
If someone asks me questions
like that...

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:28.140
I rip out their ignition!
Like this!

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:31.190
Oh, no!

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.880
"Yasunori Takada."

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:40.890
This isn't your scooter, is it?
You don't even have a key.

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:45.170
You see, I wanted
to get home fast.

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:48.140
Everybody does
it these days.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:55.140
Hey, a lot of scooters are disappearing
around here lately.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.680
You wouldn't happen to know anything
about that, would you?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:58.540
No. I don't know
nothing.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:03.810
If you tell me... How about I
do something nice for you?

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:07.150
If you give me information, I'll give
you three delicious choices.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:11.680
One, I'll pat your head. Two,
I'll rub your cheeks.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:14.660
And three, I'll give you
a great big hug.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:18.270
Number 3! Number 3!
Give me a big hug!

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:21.130
Alright, big boy.
Number 3 it is.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:39.850
Stealing bikes and all. What does
he mean "everybody does it?!"

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:42.990
That was scrump-dilly-ishous!

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:48.420
But at least we've
got a lead.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:53.430
Car 4 here. We got an idiot tied up under
the overpass at 2-Chome, Honcho.

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.730
We can't bring him in because we got the
scooter lady with us, so you pick him up.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.200
We're just on our way to the
Tsuruido housing complex.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.040
What do you
mean?

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.840
I've missed out on all of
the bargains today!

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:06.910
What the?!

00:17:19.360 --> 00:17:25.060
Aha, you can't tell if they've been
stolen or just dumped here.

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:33.210
Natsumi!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:33.970
Natsumi!
Huh?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.410
What's with
that van?

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:39.410
It looks suspicious. Might be
used for stealing regularly.

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.850
But it's just a minivan. If they're gonna
take scooters, they'd need a big truck.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.010
Scooters are small enough to
fit in a minivan, though.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.890
And did you see that license plate? They
covered it with mud on purpose!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:53.190
Stealing scooters and selling
them for a profit?!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:54.890
That's unforgivable,
Honey!

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.120
It's not really a matter
of money here...

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:58.460
Over there!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:17.550
Caught 'em red-
handed!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.690
Wait till they've
put it in.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:30.460
Get your hands
off my scooter!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:31.870
That hurt.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.560
Help.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.730
Let's beat it!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.670
Wait for me!

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:42.340
Miyuki!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.170
It's a delayed-reaction smoke
bomb. I'll fire it into the car.

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:51.080
Oops! I missed.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.220
Ow, ow. What the?

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:55.190
Let's follow them.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.090
Yeah!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:03.660
She still up
there?

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.560
I dunno, but try shaking
back and forth!

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:11.330
Thinking profit is that easy
to make! How offensive!

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:16.410
I'll teach
you!

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:19.980
Back up!

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:28.520
Give me back my
scooter, Honey!

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:50.280
SCOOTER!!!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:10.160
And now for the royal
treatment...

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.030
...gentlemen!

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:23.150
Dammit!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.380
What's that?

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.150
A mountain
on fire?

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:41.990
Forgive us! We won't do it again! Please!
We promise! We're sorry! Really!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.330
She got us
good...

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.730
Lesson learned!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:47.730
What are they talking
about?

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:49.630
No idea.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:50.310
"Grand Opening Sale"

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.910
Thank you very
much.

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.880
"Thank You"

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.540
<i>A license: 'Tis a permit</i>
<i>for all things.</i>

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:32.910
<i>A license: 'Tis the key</i>
<i>for invincibility.</i>

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:39.950
This is ridiculous!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:40.460
"Safe-Driving Campaign in Effect"
"Always Be Kind to New Drivers"

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:44.460
Hey, lady!
"Safe-Driving Campaign in Effect"
"Always Be Kind to New Drivers"

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:47.700
"Safe-Driving Campaign in Effect"
"Always Be Kind to New Drivers"

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.360
"Please obey traffic
regulations!"

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:07.180
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:19.360
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me Ionely.</i>

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:29.710
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:30.370
<i>I can feel your presence</i>

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:38.480
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.020 --> 00:22:47.280
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:56.130
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:56.470 --> 00:23:03.700
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:03.870 --> 00:23:13.420
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:16.480
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:24.560
"Holy Night"

00:23:24.990 --> 00:23:27.600
"How many nights 'til Christmas..."

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:28.830
That's not how the song goes, Natsumi!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:31.300
Xmas means presents, trees
and going out on Xmas Eve!

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:32.200
That's not what it means.

00:23:32.370 --> 00:23:34.030
Miyuki, I know you want
a date, too!

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:34.870
Not necessarily.

00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:36.200
Trouble, everybody!

00:23:36.370 --> 00:23:37.140
What, theft?!

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:38.800
Get this, the thief is Santa Claus!

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:40.370
Are you kidding?!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:43.000
Santa's supposed to be a model
figure for children!

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:46.820
Next time on You're Under Arrest,
File 11, "Santa Claus Panic."

00:23:46.950 --> 00:23:48.950
I got a bad feeling
about this...
